+    *   If rendering a slab, calculate entry $t_{near}$ and exit $t_{far}$ distances:
+        $$ t_{near} = \max(0.0, \frac{h_{bottom} - \mathbf{r}_o.y}{\mathbf{r}_d.y}) $$
+        $$ t_{far} = \frac{h_{top} - \mathbf{r}_o.y}{\mathbf{r}_d.y} $$
