+            *   **Light March (Self-Shadowing):**
+                *   Initialize light optical depth $\tau_{light} = 0$.
+                *   Loop $l$ from $1$ to $N_{lightSteps}$:
+                    *   $\mathbf{p}_l = \mathbf{p} + \mathbf{s} \cdot (l \cdot \text{lightStepDist})$ [S4, unofficial].
