+                *   Compute phase value $p(\theta)$ using Dual-Lobe Henyey-Greenstein:
+                    $$ p(\theta) = w \cdot \frac{1-g_f^2}{4\pi(1+g_f^2-2g_f\cos\theta)^{1.5}} + (1-w) \cdot \frac{1-g_b^2}{4\pi(1+g_b^2+2g_b\cos\theta)^{1.5}} $$
