+                *   Update accumulated color: $\mathbf{C}_{col} += \mathbf{C}_{scatter}$ [S4, S10, unofficial].
+                *   Update transmittance: $T *= \exp(-d \cdot step \cdot \sigma_{ext})$ [S2, S4, unofficial].
